<div class="wrap prose"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li></ol></nav><div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>This site has no accounts, forms, or comments, and we do not ask you for personal information.</p><p>Like most websites, our hosting provider may log basic technical data such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested, for security and operation.</p><p>Some pages link to other sites, such as parts retailers and contractor-matching services. Those sites have their own privacy policies, and if a link is an affiliate link they may use cookies to track referrals from us.</p><p>If this policy changes, we will update this page.</p></div></div>
